		'sections' => array(
			array( 'h' => 'Corporate Gift Packaging Should Carry a Campaign, Not Just Products', 'p' => array( 'A corporate gift set box often represents an event, holiday, onboarding program, product launch, or VIP relationship. The packaging must therefore carry a message before the recipient studies the items inside. It needs to make mixed products look coordinated rather than collected at random.', 'This product belongs with ' . vpn_batch_link( '/product-category/gift-packaging-boxes/', 'custom gift packaging boxes for business campaigns' ) . ', but the angle is campaign architecture. The box should hold the story, hierarchy, and opening sequence of the gift program.' ) ),
			array( 'h' => 'Compartment Planning for Mixed Business Gifts', 'p' => array( 'Corporate sets may include notebooks, tumblers, cards, candles, snacks, small electronics, cosmetics, or printed merchandise. Each item has a different height, surface, and weight, so the insert should be planned as a layout map rather than a simple tray.', 'Paperboard dividers, EVA, foam, molded pulp, or layered rigid inserts can be used. The insert should reveal the hero item first, keep smaller items from sliding, and allow fast packing for large campaign quantities.' ) ),
			array( 'h' => 'Rigid Structure, Magnetic Closure, and Reusable Feel', 'p' => array( 'Rigid greyboard is often appropriate because corporate recipients may keep the box on a desk or shelf. Magnetic closures create a clean opening, while lid-and-base structures are practical for heavier sets. Drawer boxes work well when the campaign wants a staged reveal.', 'The structure should be tested with the full gift weight, not only with an empty sample. Heavy items can pull against corners or make magnets feel weak if the board thickness and insert support are not planned together.' ) ),
			array( 'h' => 'Brand Message, Event Copy, and Recipient Experience', 'p' => array( 'Eight details that define this product are campaign theme, item map, insert cavity sequence, greeting card position, brand color, recipient message, closure method, and outer shipping carton. These details separate corporate gift packaging from ordinary premium boxes.', 'The inner lid can carry a thank-you message, QR campaign link, event date, or brand story. Foil stamping and embossing should support the corporate identity, but the package should still feel professional enough for international clients and partner programs.' ) ),
			array( 'h' => 'Material and Finish Choices for Business Gifting', 'p' => array( 'Specialty paper, textured paper, art paper, and rigid board can all be used depending on the campaign tone. A financial-services gift may need understated navy or grey, while a lifestyle brand may choose warmer colors or kraft textures.', 'For options, review ' . vpn_batch_link( '/paper-materials-for-custom-paper-boxes/', 'rigid board and specialty paper options' ) . '. Soft-touch lamination, foil logos, ribbon pulls, debossed marks, and spot UV can be used, but the finish should match the recipient profile instead of simply looking expensive.' ) ),
			array( 'h' => 'Bulk Campaign Production and Packing Workflow', 'p' => array( 'Corporate gift programs usually have strict delivery windows. The packaging must be easy to pack repeatedly, and the carton plan must protect the gift set after assembly. A beautiful box that is slow to load can create real pressure during large campaign fulfillment.', 'If the gift includes fragile homeware, buyers may also compare ' . vpn_batch_link( '/product/custom-dinnerware-packaging-box/', 'protective dinnerware gift packaging' ) . '. If the campaign requires carry-out presentation, ' . vpn_batch_link( '/product/custom-cosmetic-paper-bag/', 'branded paper bags for retail gifting' ) . ' can be added as a matching outer bag.' ) ),
			array( 'h' => 'Artwork Checklist for Corporate Buyers', 'p' => array( 'Send logo files, brand colors, campaign name, message copy, item dimensions, product weights, desired opening order, and shipping deadline. If the project has multiple recipient tiers, identify which items change between standard, VIP, and executive versions.', 'The design team can then prepare a dieline and insert layout that keeps the visual system consistent while allowing campaign variations. This is especially useful for agencies that manage gifting projects for several corporate clients.' ) ),
			array( 'h' => 'Quotation Information for Gift Set Boxes', 'p' => array( 'A reliable quote needs the number of items, size and weight of each item, insert preference, box structure, finish, quantity, and packing requirement. The MOQ for this custom production is 1000 boxes.', 'You can ' . vpn_batch_link( '/contact/#quote', 'request a corporate gift packaging quotation' ) . ' with a gift list and reference style. VPN Paper Box Manufacturer will suggest a structure and production plan based on the campaign goal.' ) ),
			array( 'h' => 'Why This Is Different from Supplement Drawer Packaging', 'p' => array( 'Corporate gift packaging is driven by message, recipient emotion, and mixed-item layout. Supplement drawer packaging is driven by health information, bottle fit, dosage communication, and wellness retail trust.', 'Keeping those two pages separate reduces duplicate risk because this page talks about campaigns, event timing, branded merchandise, and gifting hierarchy rather than regulated wellness product presentation.' ) ),
